WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.034 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:04.304
President Trump, this weekend,
refused to attend a ceremony

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:08.074
in France honoring American
lives lost in World War I,

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.576 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
due to bad weather.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.210 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, wait a minute.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:14.948
When you left your umbrella
outside of Air Force One,

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:18.785 line:92%
that was your only umbrella?

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:23.623 size:78% position:39%
I'm a talk-show host.
I have two umbrellas.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:28.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hope you brought
a second phone charger.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.163 line:92%
Yesterday was Veterans Day.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.631 line:92%
"Thank you for your service,"

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:35.135 line:92%
said Trump to Colonel Sanders.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:41.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Trump ]
He fought so many chicken.

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:45.145
[ Normal voice ] Florida
has ordered a mandatory recount

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:47.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
of both its Senate
and gubernatorial results

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
from last week's election,
and hopefully,

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:52.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
if all goes well with the
Florida recount, by next week,

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.920 line:92%
Al Gore will be president.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.424 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.424 --> 00:01:00.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Gore ]
I was patiently waiting.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:06.166 line:92%
I knew this day would come.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.234
[ Normal voice ]
Following the midterm elections,

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.371
Republicans will hold leadership
elections this Wednesday,

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
and current House Majority
Leader Kevin McCarthy

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
is expected to
become House Minority Leader.

00:01:15.942 --> 00:01:18.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's tough to find
someone to fill the job,

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
because no one in
the Republican Party

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:24.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
wants to have the word
"minority" in their title.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.923 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:32.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
In her upcoming memoir,
"Becoming,"

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
former First Lady
Michelle Obama reveals

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she stopped even
trying to smile

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
during President Trump's
inaugura--

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:42.368 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:45.105 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:56.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like driving in a car
that just was out of gas.

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:59.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.621 size:81% position:41% line:92%
A ghost took my voice.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
In her upcoming memoir,
"Becoming,"

00:02:03.523 --> 00:02:05.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
former First Lady
Michelle Obama reveals

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she stopped even
trying to smile

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
during President Trump's
inauguration,

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:13.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
while First Lady Melania Trump
stopped in the early '90s.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.935 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:23.009 line:92%
"I don't like the Spin Doctors."

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:27.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
and First Lady Melania

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
attended a
ceremony last week to welcome

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.051 size:84% position:42%
Justice Brett Kavanaugh
to the Supreme Court.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.754 size:81% position:41%
No word on what time
the ceremony was held,

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:38.191 line:92%
but I'm guessing Miller Time?

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:45.598 size:75% position:38%
The official Twitter
account for Fox News

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:48.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
has not posted
a message since last Thursday.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meanwhile,
the unofficial Twitter account

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:55.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
for Fox News
has posted like 1,000.

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:03.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
A woman in England
has gained media attention

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
after she revealed that she
breast-fed her daughter

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:09.222 line:92%
until she was 9 years old.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:11.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, at least she
didn't have to worry about

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
her classmates
wanting to trade lunches.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:18.231
"Uh, let's see.
I got a peanut butter and jelly.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:25.104 line:92%
What do you -- Oh, my God!"

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally, designer brand
Yves Saint Laurent

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:30.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
has released
a new line of jewelry

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.644 line:92%
that features tiny penises.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:32.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
They would
have made them bigger,

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:35.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it's their
winter collection.

